    },
    "The larger model also applies spoken corrections such as “scratch that”, but takes about four times as long." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das größere Modell setzt auch gesprochene Korrekturen wie „streich das“ um, braucht aber etwa viermal so lange."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is large. Downloading it over cellular data may use up your data plan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Modell ist groß. Der Download über mobile Daten kann dein Datenvolumen aufbrauchen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model lies in the shared Hugging Face cache. Other apps and tools that use it will have to download it again, and so will Outloud before you use it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Modell liegt im gemeinsamen Hugging-Face-Cache. Andere Apps und Tools, die es nutzen, müssen es dann erneut laden – und Outloud auch, bevor du es wieder verwendest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The models are large. Downloading them over cellular data may use up your data plan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Modelle sind groß. Der Download über mobile Daten kann dein Datenvolumen aufbrauchen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The models are not downloaded yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Modelle sind noch nicht geladen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only data transfer is downloading the models from Hugging Face, once, when you choose them." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
